
# Python bytecode from the guardrail gates (ci/gates/, sync/)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# This is a library: consumers resolve their own versions (DECISIONS.md, D-0001).
# The repositories downstream of this one commit theirs, deliberately.
/Manifest.toml

# The documentation build. docs/src/generated/ is copied in from the design notes and the
# ledgers by docs/make.jl, so that the site cannot drift from them.
/docs/build/
/docs/src/generated/
/docs/Manifest.toml
